<div id="banners"></div>

<div class="py-5 text-white text-center m-0" style="background: #f4f4f6; margin-bottom: 0px; ">
  <div class="container-fluid p-3">
    <h1 class="display-5 fw-medium" style="color: #393939;">TOPMed Imputation Server</h1>
    <p class="lead text-center" style="color: #393939">
      Free Next-Generation Genotype Imputation Service
    </p>

    {{#is(loggedIn, false)}}
    <p>
      <br>
      <a class="btn btn-lg btn-success" href="/#!pages/register">Sign up now</a>&nbsp;
      <a class="btn btn-lg btn-secondary" href="/#!pages/login">Login</a>
    </p>
    {{/is}}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="text-white" style="background: #c0143c;">
  <div class="container pt-3">
    <div class="row justify-content-center text-center ">
      <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
        <p>
          <span class="lead" style="font-size: 200%;">
            {{div(counter.complete.chromosomes, 22000000)}}M
          </span>
          <br>
          Imputed Genomes
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
        <p>
          <span class="lead" style="font-size: 200%;">
            {{counter.users}}
          </span>
          <br>
          Registered Users
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-3 text-center">
        <p>
          <span class="lead" style="font-size: 200%;">
            {{counter.queue.size}}
          </span>
          <br>
          Active Jobs
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-light py-5" style="margin-top: 0px;">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="text-center pb-3">The easiest way to impute genotypes</h2>
    <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-3 g-4 text-center">
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <p><img src="/static/img/up-cloud.png" width="105px" alt="Upload to cloud symbol"></p>
            <b>Upload your genotypes to our secured service.</b>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <p><img src="/static/img/impute.png" width="105px" alt="Imputation Symbol"></p>
            <b>Choose a reference panel</b>. We will take care of pre-phasing and imputation.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col">
        <div class="card h-100">
          <div class="card-body">
            <p><img src="/static/img/down-cloud.png" width="105px" alt="Download from cloud symbol"></p>
            <b>Download the results</b>.<br>All results are encrypted with a one-time password. After 7 days, all
            results are deleted from our server.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-light py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <h4 class="text-center pb-3">The TOPMed Imputation Server is powered by software invented and developed by the
      <a href="https://imputationserver.sph.umich.edu/index.html#!" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#michISModal">
        University of Michigan
        <svg fill="var(--color-blueberry)" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0px" y="0px" width="14px"
          height="14px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="margin-left: 0.25rem;">
          <path
            d="M 0,15.609374 V 7.2187491 H 5.1505597 10.30112 L 10.910188,6.6093432 11.519255,5.9999371 10.564316,5.044784 9.6093751,4.0896309 V 2.044815 -3.0028053e-7 H 16.804688 24 V 7.1953116 14.390624 h -2.044815 -2.044817 l -0.955152,-0.954941 -0.955154,-0.954939 -0.609406,0.609067 -0.609405,0.609069 V 18.84944 24 H 8.3906251 0 Z m 14.414062,3.246094 c 0,-1.514648 -0.0079,-2.753907 -0.01753,-2.753907 -0.0096,0 -0.821756,0.804184 -1.80471,1.787076 l -1.787189,1.787076 -3.2401772,-3.240177 -3.240177,-3.240177 1.7870754,-1.787191 c 0.9828914,-0.982954 1.7870754,-1.7950739 1.7870754,-1.8047105 0,-0.00961 -1.2392579,-0.017522 -2.7539062,-0.017522 H 2.3906249 v 6.0117185 6.011719 h 6.0117189 6.0117182 z m -0.01685,-6.146047 3.603002,-3.6030772 1.446496,1.4468272 1.446495,1.446828 h 0.358088 0.358085 V 7.1953116 2.3906241 H 16.804688 12 v 0.3577821 0.3577821 l 1.025391,1.028297 c 0.563964,0.5655636 1.209333,1.2172855 1.434153,1.4482713 L 14.8683,6.0027304 11.272086,9.5990023 7.675871,13.195274 9.2343514,14.753887 c 0.8571646,0.857237 1.5587886,1.558612 1.5591656,1.558612 3.77e-4,0 1.622035,-1.621385 3.603688,-3.603078 z">
          </path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      and driven by data provided by the investigators of the <a href="https://nhlbiwgs.org/" data-toggle="modal"
        data-target="#topmedModal">
        TOPMed Program
        <svg fill="var(--color-blueberry)" version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" x="0px" y="0px" width="14px"
          height="14px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="margin-left: 0.25rem;">
          <path
            d="M 0,15.609374 V 7.2187491 H 5.1505597 10.30112 L 10.910188,6.6093432 11.519255,5.9999371 10.564316,5.044784 9.6093751,4.0896309 V 2.044815 -3.0028053e-7 H 16.804688 24 V 7.1953116 14.390624 h -2.044815 -2.044817 l -0.955152,-0.954941 -0.955154,-0.954939 -0.609406,0.609067 -0.609405,0.609069 V 18.84944 24 H 8.3906251 0 Z m 14.414062,3.246094 c 0,-1.514648 -0.0079,-2.753907 -0.01753,-2.753907 -0.0096,0 -0.821756,0.804184 -1.80471,1.787076 l -1.787189,1.787076 -3.2401772,-3.240177 -3.240177,-3.240177 1.7870754,-1.787191 c 0.9828914,-0.982954 1.7870754,-1.7950739 1.7870754,-1.8047105 0,-0.00961 -1.2392579,-0.017522 -2.7539062,-0.017522 H 2.3906249 v 6.0117185 6.011719 h 6.0117189 6.0117182 z m -0.01685,-6.146047 3.603002,-3.6030772 1.446496,1.4468272 1.446495,1.446828 h 0.358088 0.358085 V 7.1953116 2.3906241 H 16.804688 12 v 0.3577821 0.3577821 l 1.025391,1.028297 c 0.563964,0.5655636 1.209333,1.2172855 1.434153,1.4482713 L 14.8683,6.0027304 11.272086,9.5990023 7.675871,13.195274 9.2343514,14.753887 c 0.8571646,0.857237 1.5587886,1.558612 1.5591656,1.558612 3.77e-4,0 1.622035,-1.621385 3.603688,-3.603078 z">
          </path>
        </svg>
      </a>.
    </h4>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- News and Logos -->
<div class="py-5 bg-light">
  <div class="container  ">
    <div class="card ">
      <div class="card-body">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="row">
            <h5 style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
              Latest News
            </h5>

            <hr style="padding-top: 0px; margin-top: 0px;">

            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 01 December 2025</small>
              <br>
              We are pleased to announce the release of Version 2 of the TOPMed Imputation Server. Our improved
              infrastructure offers more robust performance with minimal changes to the web UI. If you are accessing the
              API programmatically, please note that there have been some changes to the input and output formats. For
              more details, check out <a href="https://statgen.github.io/tis-v2-docs/">our new documentation.</a>
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 11 March 2024</small>
              <br>
              We would like to remind users that there is a limit of <b>three concurrent jobs per person</b>. The TOPMed
              imputation server is a free resource, and these limits allow us to provide service to a wide audience.
              Please do not attempt to bypass these limits by creating multiple accounts. We monitor usage, and reserve
              the right to terminate jobs or accounts that are in violation of the policy.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 07 December 2023</small>
              <br>
              We have released the new TOPMed-r3 reference panel, with ~30% more sites and samples than TOPMed-r2. The
              server has been updated to improve security and performance. Additional details about the new panel and
              updates will be described soon. The TOPMed-r2 panel is no longer available. Automated scripts should be
              updated to use <i>topmed-r3</i>, as shown in the latest
              <a href="https://statgen.github.io/tis-v2-docs/api/api-overview">documentation</a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 12 June 2023</small>
              <br>
              As users of TOPMed data, we'd like to call your attention to the following funding call:
              <a href="https://grants.nih.gov/grants/guide/notice-files/NOT-HL-23-067.html">
                Integrative Omics Analysis of NHLBI TOPMed Data
              </a>.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 17 May 2021</small>
              <br>
              We are happy to announce that service has returned to full capacity. We have made significant system
              changes to the underlying infrastructure to help address past performance issues, and will continue to
              monitor the system closely. Thank you for your patience!
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 21 October 2020</small>
              <br>
              <b>Scheduled Maintenance Announcement:</b> An Imputation Server maintenance window is planned for
              Thursday, October 22nd starting at 5:00PM EST. through Sunday, October 25th. During this window, no new
              jobs will be able to be created. All existing jobs will finish as scheduled.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 12 August 2020</small>
              <br>
              The server is online with full functionality after the latest maintenance window. We have also made
              improvements to efficiency and increased overall throughput. If you notice any issues, please contact us.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 1 May 2020</small>
              <br>
              The server continues to be under a heavy load and jobs may be queued for long periods of time. Jobs may
              still be running even after an email notification has been sent. Please do not cancel and restart jobs as
              that removes your place in the queue.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 13 April 2020</small>
              <br>
              Due to heavy load on the Imputation Server, we are experiencing intermittent job failures. Please bear
              with us as we work to improve job queueing under heavy load. As possible, users may want to delay job
              submission until the load subsides. We are excited that the TOPMed panel is in such high demand and are
              working to ensure that the server performs well.
            </p>
            <p>
              <small class="text-muted"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt"></i> 10 March 2020</small>
              <br>
              Based on whole genome sequence under NHLBI's TOPMed Program, imputation from a TOPMed reference panel will
              soon be available to the community. Built from 97,256 deeply sequenced human genomes, this panel contains
              308,107,085 genetic variants, and improves imputation compared to existing reference panels. The TOPMed
              Imputation Server is running in a cloud computing environment supported by the NHLBI BioData Catalyst
              program. The panel and server are currently in beta-testing. Imputation with HRC and 1000 Genome panels
              are still supported at Michigan Imputation Server.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- IS Modal -->
